- op: discuss  # e3eb
  at: '2026-03-19T02:06:20Z'  # e3eb
  by: agent  # e3eb
  actor: jgstern_agent  # e3eb
  clock: 5  # e3eb
  nonce: e3eb  # e3eb
  message: "Fixed in PR #2389. Local function calls now resolve via base_name lookup before falling back to global resolver. Root cause: functions registered as 'a/1' (with arity) but calls use bare 'a'. Tested on rabbitmq: a/1 in rabbit_priority_queue gets 6 edges (was 0). Should significantly reduce the 45% Erlang orphan rate."  # e3eb
